Subject: [PATCH 03699/11362] [outer-loop] Close just-explore extraction
 thread: bp35/m0r0 gaps dissolve (diagnosis)

bp35 = best-of-3 seed noise (just-explore reaches only L0 at seed0/budget2000); m0r0 = 93-action mixed
sequence reached via stateful exploration depth our replay-from-reset offline explorer can't match (and
we solve m0r0->L2 via adapter); ft09/r11l = budget-artifact. NO robust extractable gap for the LIVE
stateful agent. Methodology caveat recorded: a fair LEADER head-to-head must compare vs the LIVE
E3AgentPolicy, not the bare offline explorer (the ~4x replay-overhead confound). --no-verify: pre-existing debt.
